00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.160
Like what's going on?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.540
And eventually you realize, no, it's the select button.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.440
So it's really push.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:02.100
You would go to the shoulder buttons before the select button.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:03.680
And start. No, of course not.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.260
I will say the select button was the last thing I pressed.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.180
I mean, that makes sense, I guess.

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.300
