00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:04.540
If we can talk about the actual game though, you know, bad start menu aside, Indiana Jones, the temple of doom.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:10.100
It basically, you, you are Indiana and, uh, or Indy as I guess people call him.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:17.820
And you have to make your way through the temple in a series of 12 levels or waves as they might call them in the game.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:19.780
