00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.260
It's just a action adventure game.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:32.880
Uh, you go throughout these temples and you have to like find a bunch of children and then they leave you like scraps, like guns and blades and keys.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:44.100
And then you collect those things and you're just trying to collect, round up all the children and get the key and hopefully acquire enough equipment so that you can continue to progress through the game.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:48.360
Yeah. I mean, it's a pretty standard, uh, loop there.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:54.740
Uh, one thing that I'll note is, uh, on one of those, uh, press select to actually start the game screens.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:58.240
It, it, it does give you a very brief rundown of what you're supposed to do.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:09.680
